{
    "title": "Kids Piano",
    "description": "Kids Piano is a free piano playing app for kids. It turns your phone or tablet into a real piano instrument. However, everything in Kids Piano from interface, color, function, use... is designed for children. In addition to piano instruments, many other musical instruments are integrated including piano, organ, xylophone, trumpet, drum... the vocals of the music teacher, the sounds of animals such as dogs, cats... Lots of songs for kids to learn and play from simple to advanced. Kids Piano has music games to train children's skills to help them be agile, skillful and increase their musical perception. Advanced music content such as chords, accompaniment ... for children with higher musical knowledge.\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Full keyboards of piano, color piano keys for kids\r\n- Piano, organ, xylophone, trumpet and drumset\r\n- Teacher singer\r\n- Animal sounds: Cat, Dog...\r\n- Many songs for kids play and learn piano\r\n- Piano games\r\n- And many other functions are waiting for you to discover...\r\n\r\nTo stay active, the application only displays a small banner ad at the bottom of the screen and never displays ads when playing the piano as well as pop-up ads. If you don't want you can hide this banner ads whenever you want.\r\nWe always respect our users.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Kids Piano is a free piano playing app for kids. It turns your phone or tablet into a real piano instrument. However, everything in Kids Piano from interface, color, function, use... is designed for children. In addition to piano instruments, many other musical instruments are integrated including piano, organ, xylophone, trumpet, drum... the vocals of the music teacher, the sounds of animals such as dogs, cats... Lots of songs for kids to learn and play from simple to advanced. Kids Piano has music games to train children&#39;s skills to help them be agile, skillful and increase their musical perception. Advanced music content such as chords, accompaniment ... for children with higher musical knowledge.<br>Features:<br>- Full keyboards of piano, color piano keys for kids<br>- Piano, organ, xylophone, trumpet and drumset<br>- Teacher singer<br>- Animal sounds: Cat, Dog...<br>- Many songs for kids play and learn piano<br>- Piano games<br>- And many other functions are waiting for you to discover...<br><br>To stay active, the application only displays a small banner ad at the bottom of the screen and never displays ads when playing the piano as well as pop-up ads. If you don&#39;t want you can hide this banner ads whenever you want.<br>We always respect our users.",
